{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Web</strong> is a <i>First person pure walking simulator,</i> an experimental art game, a surreal journey. You explore an interconnected web of environments.  Each environment is unique and contains unique assets.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover strange places and meet odd characters.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay description:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is pure exploration. You can walk, look and jump. It is a <strong>pure</strong> walking simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The story</strong> of the game is the path you take. You are in a strange world, and you choose where to go. There might be stories in the places you discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Web changes, grows and evolves with time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New environments will be added frequently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Everything is subject to change</i>, anything can be completely different or entirely gone with each update.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>There is no AI used in this game</i>, not even for reference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Buy it once, and every update is free forever.</i></strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Release date to be announced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Similar gameplay:</i></strong><i> LSD: Dream Emulator, KID A MNESIA</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3709580?t=1758716957","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709580/bb88a0505671292bb3ce8200e247afe69de6dcab/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758716957","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/370958